1
00:21:35,794 --> 00:21:36,920
Hey, buddy!

2
00:21:46,388 --> 00:21:49,182
What do you mean you didn't see me?
I was right in front of you, man.

3
00:22:01,361 --> 00:22:02,154
I'm okay.

4
00:22:02,195 --> 00:22:02,904
Good.

5
00:22:15,459 --> 00:22:16,251
Come on in, boss.

6
00:22:24,801 --> 00:22:25,302
That's right.

7
00:22:30,807 --> 00:22:31,600
I don't care.

8
00:22:33,852 --> 00:22:35,354
The suite is occupied right now.

9
00:22:35,354 --> 00:22:36,104
Really?

10
00:22:36,104 --> 00:22:36,772
Really.

11
00:23:23,193 --> 00:23:24,194
Yes, boss.

12
00:23:24,361 --> 00:23:26,905
It was the one closest
to the office.

13
00:23:38,166 --> 00:23:39,042
So?

14
00:23:49,136 --> 00:23:50,220
Sorry, boss.

15
00:23:50,971 --> 00:23:52,681
They told me you'd be fine

16
00:23:52,681 --> 00:23:54,808
staying at a hotel
near the office.

17
00:25:13,303 --> 00:25:15,597
That's the Cow House.
It's famous here in Tijuana.

18
00:25:15,597 --> 00:25:16,681
It's been on TV.

19
00:25:23,563 --> 00:25:24,189
Come on in.

20
00:25:45,335 --> 00:25:46,253
Hi, Mom!

21
00:25:47,712 --> 00:25:49,172
What's up, son?

22
00:25:54,302 --> 00:25:55,637
He's my new boss!

23
00:26:15,448 --> 00:26:16,783
Damn shorty.

24
00:26:25,792 --> 00:26:27,919
Until I find him an apartment
somewhere around town.

25
00:26:37,679 --> 00:26:39,180
Easy, boss.

26
00:26:39,973 --> 00:26:41,516
He needs to rest, Mom.
Please.

27
00:26:50,150 --> 00:26:51,985
Damn shorty.

28
00:27:01,453 --> 00:27:02,829
That's the Leopard's room.

29
00:27:03,246 --> 00:27:04,039
My room.

30
00:27:27,687 --> 00:27:29,648
I'm only twenty-nine, man.

31
00:29:06,453 --> 00:29:08,580
Is little Yuca still asleep,
or what's going on?

32
00:29:11,833 --> 00:29:13,251
It's getting late,
isn't it?

33
00:29:27,390 --> 00:29:29,100
Wake up!
It's getting late!

34
00:29:53,041 --> 00:29:54,542
He knows what's up!

35
00:30:03,218 --> 00:30:04,135
Hey, Sarny, come here!

36
00:30:04,135 --> 00:30:05,386
Hey, sit!
Stay!

37
00:30:05,637 --> 00:30:06,471
Good boy.

38
00:30:08,473 --> 00:30:09,557
Of course!

39
00:30:09,682 --> 00:30:10,350
Look.

40
00:30:10,517 --> 00:30:12,101
Hey, Sarny!
Do you speak English?

41
00:30:22,612 --> 00:30:23,446
Right?

42
00:30:24,614 --> 00:30:26,074
What would you like
for breakfast, boss?

43
00:31:30,972 --> 00:31:32,348
Hey, Sarny, come here.

44
00:31:44,652 --> 00:31:47,155
I couldn't make him sleep
in the living room, Mom.

45
00:32:09,052 --> 00:32:10,053
Okay.

46
00:32:18,895 --> 00:32:20,229
It's a joke.

47
00:32:28,488 --> 00:32:30,323
Are you listening to me?

48
00:32:31,616 --> 00:32:32,492
Okay.

49
00:32:33,701 --> 00:32:34,661
Don't worry.

50
00:32:45,004 --> 00:32:46,506
Easy, kid.

51
00:32:46,506 --> 00:32:48,341
Easy.

52
00:33:01,479 --> 00:33:02,730
Okay.

53
00:33:05,733 --> 00:33:07,276
Tell him not to bother me.

54
00:33:15,702 --> 00:33:16,744
Wait, son!

55
00:33:17,078 --> 00:33:18,538
Wait, wait, wait.

56
00:33:23,209 --> 00:33:24,961
I made you a burrito
with beans and rice.

57
00:34:04,876 --> 00:34:07,378
Hey, what's up, Spooky?

58
00:34:10,006 --> 00:34:11,215
Who's that little guy?

59
00:34:29,734 --> 00:34:32,695
I'll tell the boss
we've got a new manager.

60
00:34:36,908 --> 00:34:38,910
Don't be late for school, okay?

61
00:34:42,538 --> 00:34:44,665
Hey, take it easy, boss.

62
00:35:19,492 --> 00:35:20,243
Hey, guys!

63
00:35:20,785 --> 00:35:22,161
Meet the new boss.

64
00:35:31,754 --> 00:35:32,964
Nice to meet you, boss.

65
00:35:39,428 --> 00:35:40,471
All right.

66
00:36:27,935 --> 00:36:29,187
Hi, guys!

67
00:36:57,131 --> 00:36:57,965
This way.

68
00:37:00,259 --> 00:37:03,221
Things are about to get tough, huh?

69
00:37:37,296 --> 00:37:37,922
Hey!

70
00:37:39,215 --> 00:37:40,466
Don't play dumb with me,
okay?

71
00:37:40,466 --> 00:37:41,217
You know why I'm here.

72
00:37:41,217 --> 00:37:42,593
I'm waiting for my package.

73
00:37:42,677 --> 00:37:44,220
It hasn't been delivered.

74
00:37:44,387 --> 00:37:46,138
First you tell me,
"In a minute."

75
00:37:46,180 --> 00:37:47,890
Then you tell me,
"In a little while."

76
00:37:48,015 --> 00:37:49,267
And then you tell me,
"Tomorrow."

77
00:37:49,267 --> 00:37:51,060
And guess what?
Today is tomorrow.

78
00:37:51,143 --> 00:37:52,270
And I still don't have my package.

79
00:37:53,354 --> 00:37:55,439
Let me check what's going on
with your package.

80
00:37:55,481 --> 00:37:56,274
My what?

81
00:37:56,732 --> 00:37:57,942
Your package.

82
00:37:57,984 --> 00:37:58,776
My packa—

83
00:37:58,776 --> 00:37:59,652
Do you have your order number?

84
00:37:59,652 --> 00:38:00,861
No!
I don't have a fucking order number!

85
00:38:00,861 --> 00:38:02,488
You know what?
Talking to you is a waste of time!

86
00:38:02,488 --> 00:38:04,198
Get your manager,
right now!

87
00:38:05,241 --> 00:38:06,200
Go get him!

88
00:38:06,242 --> 00:38:08,077
Hey, calm down!

89
00:38:08,286 --> 00:38:09,453
Wait a minute.

90
00:38:11,831 --> 00:38:13,833
Are you fucking kidding me?

91
00:38:16,252 --> 00:38:18,004
What the fuck are you doing?

92
00:38:18,546 --> 00:38:20,548
Open the damn door, you idiot!

93
00:38:20,548 --> 00:38:21,841
Open the fucking door!

94
00:38:22,383 --> 00:38:23,509
Open the door!

95
00:38:42,111 --> 00:38:43,738
No, take your time, please.

96
00:38:45,698 --> 00:38:46,782
A couple of idiots.

97
00:38:50,953 --> 00:38:52,955
Do I look like I speak Spanish?

98
00:38:53,164 --> 00:38:54,290
English!

99
00:39:01,839 --> 00:39:04,175
I'm gonna stop you right there
because I don't give a damn.

100
00:39:05,301 --> 00:39:08,262
I need my shotgun, now.

101
00:39:08,304 --> 00:39:09,305
I don't understand you.

102
00:39:09,430 --> 00:39:10,681
Did he call me a bitch?

103
00:39:35,122 --> 00:39:36,165
That old guy is crazy.

104
00:39:36,165 --> 00:39:37,333
What did you call me?

105
00:39:38,209 --> 00:39:39,043
Look here.

106
00:39:39,168 --> 00:39:42,380
When the hell are you going
to deliver my shotgun?

107
00:39:42,421 --> 00:39:42,838
Shut up.

108
00:39:43,339 --> 00:39:44,298
Calm down, wait.

109
00:39:47,635 --> 00:39:50,596
Okay.
Hello, hello, Mr. Johnson.

110
00:39:50,638 --> 00:39:51,514
Hello.

111
00:39:51,931 --> 00:39:52,765
How are you?

112
00:39:54,100 --> 00:39:56,560
I'm fine now that I can see
your beautiful face.

113
00:39:58,437 --> 00:40:00,981
Your boss is an asshole.

114
00:40:11,534 --> 00:40:12,535
I lo—

115
00:40:12,701 --> 00:40:14,537
They don't know where
my package is,

116
00:40:14,578 --> 00:40:16,747
and I need to know where it is
because it's very important.

117
00:40:19,458 --> 00:40:21,001
Oh, my God!
You're so beautiful.

118
00:40:23,629 --> 00:40:25,506
She's amazing!

119
00:40:28,551 --> 00:40:30,052
What the fuck are you looking at?

120
00:40:35,558 --> 00:40:36,767
Hey!
What's up, boss?

121
00:40:47,027 --> 00:40:47,987
Hey, man!

122
00:41:30,070 --> 00:41:30,821
I've got it.

123
00:44:57,986 --> 00:44:58,987
Sorry!
Sorry, boss!

124
00:45:27,850 --> 00:45:29,393
It's okay.
No problem.

125
00:48:36,079 --> 00:48:38,582
You know how it goes, brother.

126
00:48:53,138 --> 00:48:54,014
Cheers.

127
00:48:54,014 --> 00:48:55,015
Cheers!

128
00:54:22,217 --> 00:54:23,134
Let's go.

129
00:54:23,885 --> 00:54:25,345
Stop, Spooky.

130
00:54:36,773 --> 00:54:38,149
I'm sad, you understand?

131
00:54:55,208 --> 00:54:56,376
<i>Baby</i>

132
00:54:56,626 --> 00:54:58,545
<i>I love you so much</i>

133
00:55:00,797 --> 00:55:02,966
<i>I want you to know</i>

134
00:55:04,175 --> 00:55:07,762
<i>That I'm</i>
<i>gonna miss your love</i>

135
00:55:08,763 --> 00:55:12,058
<i>The moment that you</i>
<i>walk out that door</i>

136
00:55:12,684 --> 00:55:14,728
<i>So please,</i>
<i>don't go</i>

137
00:55:15,437 --> 00:55:16,771
<i>Don't go</i>

138
00:55:18,189 --> 00:55:20,108
<i>Don't go away</i>

139
00:55:20,317 --> 00:55:22,110
<i>Please don't go</i>

140
00:55:22,902 --> 00:55:25,864
<i>Don't go</i>

141
00:55:26,197 --> 00:55:28,783
<i>I'm begging you to stay</i>

142
00:57:06,464 --> 00:57:07,465
Are you sure?

143
00:57:46,296 --> 00:57:47,547
You know how it goes.

144
00:57:48,256 --> 00:57:50,383
Here in Tijuana,
we might seem coldhearted.

145
01:00:42,221 --> 01:00:44,307
Let's go, buddy!
The party's here!

146
01:02:06,931 --> 01:02:08,516
What's your problem, delivery boy?

147
01:02:08,808 --> 01:02:10,017
Got a package for me?

148
01:02:20,987 --> 01:02:22,572
You got a problem
with me, man?

149
01:02:38,296 --> 01:02:39,172
Stop!

150
01:02:40,631 --> 01:02:41,674
Are you okay, Spooky?

151
01:03:01,486 --> 01:03:02,195
That's all.

152
01:03:08,409 --> 01:03:09,327
I'm sorry.

153
01:03:10,536 --> 01:03:11,078
Listen to me.

154
01:03:40,024 --> 01:03:40,525
Come on!

155
01:03:54,121 --> 01:03:54,789
Yes!
Exactly!

156
01:03:56,040 --> 01:03:56,999
That's enough, man.

157
01:08:27,144 --> 01:08:28,437
Wake up, man!

158
01:08:31,065 --> 01:08:32,733
Spooky, wake up.

159
01:08:40,199 --> 01:08:41,325
Good morning.

160
01:12:54,995 --> 01:12:57,373
I need to talk to you guys,
right now.

161
01:13:02,211 --> 01:13:02,920
Right now!

162
01:13:14,306 --> 01:13:15,599
Good news, boss!

163
01:13:20,104 --> 01:13:21,271
Did you have a fight
with your wife?

164
01:15:24,436 --> 01:15:25,646
Help me out, guys.

165
01:15:54,299 --> 01:15:55,551
Please, guys.

166
01:16:46,935 --> 01:16:48,687
What happened, you damn Yuca?

167
01:17:08,332 --> 01:17:10,667
Only rich and famous people
live around here.

168
01:17:21,178 --> 01:17:22,638
We'll give you a ride
to your neighborhood.

169
01:17:53,627 --> 01:17:55,003
What did you call me, fatty?

170
01:19:00,861 --> 01:19:01,820
From the border.

171
01:19:04,990 --> 01:19:07,075
Across the border,
nothing but hot dogs.

172
01:19:18,253 --> 01:19:21,214
My Tijuana is so beautiful.

173
01:20:03,965 --> 01:20:06,092
They don't have any money.

174
01:20:36,122 --> 01:20:37,499
The best in town.

175
01:20:51,137 --> 01:20:52,472
Hey, Caro, my love!

176
01:20:55,559 --> 01:20:56,977
What's up, baby?

177
01:21:16,288 --> 01:21:17,622
I'm screwed.

178
01:21:24,671 --> 01:21:25,755
See you.

179
01:21:26,798 --> 01:21:28,341
See you later, sweetheart.

180
01:21:40,854 --> 01:21:42,439
You too, fatty!

181
01:22:15,430 --> 01:22:16,556
Home, sweet home.

182
01:22:24,064 --> 01:22:25,273
Come on, come on, come on.

183
01:22:42,248 --> 01:22:42,874
Watch out, fatty!

184
01:22:44,209 --> 01:22:46,336
We'll pick you up in two hours.

185
01:25:49,644 --> 01:25:50,770
Move, fatty!

186
01:29:12,472 --> 01:29:14,557
He's a useless receptionist.

187
01:33:17,883 --> 01:33:19,260
I'm going to look
for an apartment.

188
01:33:24,056 --> 01:33:25,099
Sorry.

189
01:33:39,030 --> 01:33:41,490
May they fly high.

190
01:33:47,913 --> 01:33:49,248
She's a great woman.

191
01:34:07,516 --> 01:34:08,601
Okay.

192
01:34:09,310 --> 01:34:10,102
Okay.

193
01:34:18,527 --> 01:34:19,570
Can Mom get a hug?

194
01:36:06,635 --> 01:36:07,928
What's up, sir?

195
01:36:12,349 --> 01:36:14,018
What's up, kids?

196
01:36:14,018 --> 01:36:14,810
What's up, Mom?

197
01:36:14,810 --> 01:36:15,770
All good, my friend.

198
01:36:15,770 --> 01:36:16,562
Come here, sweetheart.

199
01:36:16,979 --> 01:36:18,147
Come on, come on!

200
01:36:28,282 --> 01:36:29,158
It's yours.

201
01:36:33,913 --> 01:36:34,830
Are you listening to me?

202
01:36:34,830 --> 01:36:36,123
I'm listening to you!

203
01:36:37,666 --> 01:36:39,001
This is too much.

204
01:36:40,002 --> 01:36:40,795
Thank you!

205
01:36:40,961 --> 01:36:42,004
Okay, okay, okay.

206
01:36:43,422 --> 01:36:45,007
See you, guys!

207
01:37:16,789 --> 01:37:18,290
Calm down, boss.

208
01:37:21,001 --> 01:37:22,253
Everything's going to be okay.

209
01:37:29,510 --> 01:37:30,386
It's all good.

210
01:37:40,396 --> 01:37:42,606
What if she got back together
with the guy on the motorcycle?

211
01:38:35,284 --> 01:38:36,660
Will you marry me?

212
01:39:39,431 --> 01:39:40,849
I'm leaving the office
in your hands.

213
01:39:49,692 --> 01:39:50,609
See you, man!

214
01:39:50,651 --> 01:39:51,360
See you!
